                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I really wanted to recommend Resonance but I can't. I encountered a game breaking bug forcing me to go back to a too old save and I can't see myself do that.\r\nThe game is really good and the story seems interesting. The puzzle are some of the hardest I have seen in this genre but the very innovative Memory system helps not making them frustrating.\r\nThe Memory system is really well thought and brings a lot to the genre. I know I am late to the party but I really hope the developers fix their game.",
